{"id":"n53799-1-7","stage":5,"title":"떠밀리다 · 被推","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n53799-1-7-1","ko":"조금 전까지 옆에 있던 승규가 안 보이네.","zh":"刚才还在旁边的承奎不见了啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"조금","meaning":"片刻，一会儿","explanation":"조금：片刻，一会儿","readings":[{"term":"조금","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61176","senseId":"2","lemma":"조금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"전까지","meaning":"前","explanation":"전：前；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。","readings":[{"term":"전","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17301","senseId":"2","lemma":"전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"옆에","meaning":"旁，旁边","explanation":"옆：旁，旁边；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"옆","audio":"/audio/c140e1936b454b24fb3a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20243","senseId":"1","lemma":"옆","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있던","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"승규가","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"승규가","audio":"/audio/035e382cdd18f08ebfad.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보이네.","meaning":"看起来，看上去","explanation":"보이다：看起来，看上去；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"4","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"b4049b7414b62d9b","term":"조금","zh":"片刻，一会儿","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3","entryId":"61176","definition":"短暂时间。","pronunciation":["조금"]},{"id":"d9f427c3257e81e0","term":"전","zh":"前","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3","entryId":"17301","definition":"比一定时期早。","pronunciation":["전"]},{"id":"c140e1936b454b24","term":"옆","zh":"旁，旁边","audio":"/audio/c140e1936b454b24fb3a.mp3","entryId":"20243","definition":"指左右两侧中的一侧。","pronunciation":["엽"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"看起来，看上去","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"认为或判断出某对象怎样。","pronunciation":["보이다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d990093a9b614ae143f1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n53799-1-7-2","ko":"인파에 떠밀려서 뒤로 밀려났나 봐.","zh":"应该是被人群挤到后面去了吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"인파에","meaning":"人流","explanation":"인파：人流；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"인파","audio":"/audio/0fb5914210311bc33635.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72265","senseId":"1","lemma":"인파","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"떠밀려서","meaning":"被推，被推动","explanation":"떠밀리다：被推，被推动；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"떠밀리다","audio":"/audio/9589397566ce9ebd7483.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"53799","senseId":"1","lemma":"떠밀리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뒤로","meaning":"后，后面","explanation":"뒤：后，后面；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"뒤","audio":"/audio/c65326b2de936236c222.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67477","senseId":"1","lemma":"뒤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"밀려났나","meaning":"被挤，被赶出来","explanation":"밀려나다：被挤，被赶出来；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"밀려나다","audio":"/audio/0b74cbd182a2bae85143.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57421","senseId":"1","lemma":"밀려나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"0fb5914210311bc3","term":"인파","zh":"人流","audio":"/audio/0fb5914210311bc33635.mp3","entryId":"72265","definition":"聚集在一处的许多的人。","pronunciation":["인파"]},{"id":"9589397566ce9ebd","term":"떠밀리다","zh":"被推，被推动","audio":"/audio/9589397566ce9ebd7483.mp3","entryId":"53799","definition":"被外力用力向前移动。","pronunciation":["떠밀리다"]},{"id":"c65326b2de936236","term":"뒤","zh":"后，后面","audio":"/audio/c65326b2de936236c222.mp3","entryId":"67477","definition":"朝向的反方向。","pronunciation":["뒤ː"]},{"id":"0b74cbd182a2bae8","term":"밀려나다","zh":"被挤，被赶出来","audio":"/audio/0b74cbd182a2bae85143.mp3","entryId":"57421","definition":"被某个位置上挪到别处或被驱赶到别的地方。","pronunciation":["밀려나다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/01893f606dc5c83adb1e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.584,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=53799","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":173,"sequenceScore":3.4107,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["应该是被人群挤到后面去了吧。","食材太少了，怎么办啊？","刚才还在旁边的承奎不见了啊。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["应该是被人群挤到后面去了吧。","刚才还在旁边的承奎不见了啊。","食材太少了，怎么办啊？"],"answer":0}]}
